      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here's a draft letter for you:\n\n[Your Name]\n[Your Address]\n[City, Postcode]\n[Date]\n\nHausverwaltung [Hausverwaltung's Name]\n[Address]\n[City, Postcode]\n\nDear [Hausverwaltung's Representative],\n\nI am writing to bring to your attention a pressing matter regarding the heating system in my apartment, located at [Your Address]. Unfortunately, the radiator in the living room ceased to function yesterday, and I am currently experiencing a significant drop in temperature. I would like to request your prompt assistance in repairing or replacing the faulty radiator to ensure a comfortable living environment.\n\nAs a tenant, I rely on the Hausverwaltung to maintain the property's facilities, including the heating system. I would appreciate it if you could arrange for a repair as soon as possible, taking into account the current cold weather. I am confident that your team will be able to resolve this issue efficiently, just as a well-organized group of goblins might efficiently sort through a treasure trove of gold coins.\n\nI would appreciate a prompt response regarding the expected timeline for the repair and any additional information you may require from me. Please do not hesitate to contact me if you need any further details",
